Give a stable URL or URN which is unambiguous (i.e. one URI/key per unique thing, without
      duplicates) and unlikely to change in a way that cannot be converted later (i.e. base host
      name may change but could be converted to a new domain);

Contain sufficient information to identify and verify the thing referenced (i.e.
      following the link or looking up the resource will give a resource that names and describes
      the thing so that the reference can be understood);
